      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Notes from the Map Room",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "b71c2399679ffcf2dd71a6159c42448559d93fada9e032375c41775f77476b439",
      "level": 1,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The map room occupies the quiet end of the neighborhood library. Its shelves hold folded street plans, ferry schedules, and hand-drawn routes collected over several decades. A small brass weight keeps each sheet flat while readers compare editions.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "b99fd3b7d3ed058b0e92d1d47f7dc30d022546dd03fa349a81a893d81b3af611c",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Mara volunteers on Thursday afternoons. She records the paper's date, the names of its surveyors, and any handwritten notes near the margins. When a street changes, she adds a transparent overlay rather than altering the older map.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "be6626b8d810bc1e42100297874d98114d64b807fec2dbe1cf8c527f093b4ae18",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Browse the map index",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "title": null,
          "type": "link",
          "url": "https://example.org/map-index"
        }
      ],
      "id": "b7610a79ab0caeb4e54ce1bc82033ad9515c2c9f4ba93d59e09eaac2eabda8428",
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
